*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0033
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-04-12 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-11-04 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 697
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP090
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0033.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY FRD0033C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    *> HOLD TRANSACTION FLAG
    05 TXN-HOLD-IND       PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> MANUAL REVIEW FLAG
    05 REVIEW-FLAG        PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM CHECK-CHANNEL
    DISPLAY "TXN-HOLD-IND=" TXN-HOLD-IND
    DISPLAY "REVIEW-FLAG=" REVIEW-FLAG
    STOP RUN.
CHECK-CHANNEL.
    IF TXN-CHANNEL = 'O'
        *> CARD-NOT-PRESENT ONLINE PURCHASE
        IF CARD-PRESENT = 'N'
           AND TXN-AMOUNT GREATER THAN 1750
            MOVE 'Y' TO TXN-HOLD-IND
            MOVE 'Y' TO REVIEW-FLAG
        *> LARGE ONLINE TRANSACTION
        ELSE IF TXN-AMOUNT GREATER THAN 20000
            MOVE 'Y' TO REVIEW-FLAG
        END-IF
        END-IF
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO TXN-HOLD-IND
    END-IF.
